 harm. Till date, the firebird remains (8) ______, as no one has ever captured an image of the bird or found its feather, believed to possess magical healing properties.]',array('pallid','coveted','adorned','endeared'),1,'জারের \'সোনার আপেল\' মূল্যবান ও সবার আকাঙ্ক্ষিত; তাই coveted (প্রত্যাশিত/লোভনীয়) উপযুক্ত।',false,'ok',26),array('english','[Questions 25 to 28: Read the text below and decide which option (A, B, C, or D) best fits the gap. Originating primarily in Russian fairy tales, the Firebird is rarely seen as a (5) ______ entity that causes harm. In some classic tales, the bird is famous for stealing a tsar\'s (6) ______ golden apple. In other stories as well, it is depicted as a mischievous and (7) ______ creature, prone to doing strange things, but not as an evil being intent on causing harm. Till date, the firebird remains (8) ______, as no one has ever captured an image of the bird or found its feather, believed to possess magical healing properties.]',array('whimsical','depraved','voyeuristic','churlish'),0,'দুষ্টু (mischievous) ও অদ্ভুত কাজ করার প্রবণতার সঙ্গে whimsical (খামখেয়ালি) মেলে; depraved বা churlish নেতিবাচক।',false,'ok',27),array('english','[Questions 25 to 28: Read the text below and decide which option (A, B, C, or D) best fits the gap. Originating primarily in Russian fairy tales, the Firebird is rarely seen as a (5) ______ entity that causes harm. In some classic tales, the bird is famous for stealing a tsar\'s (6) ______ golden apple. In other stories as well, it is depicted as a mischievous and (7) ______ creature, prone to doing strange things, but not as an evil being intent on causing harm. Till date, the firebird remains (8) ______, as no one has ever captured an image of the bird or found its feather, believed to possess magical healing properties.]',array('deceptive','paranormal','elusive','ingenue'),2,'কেউ ছবি তুলতে বা পালক খুঁজে পায়নি, অর্থাৎ পাখিটি ধরাছোঁয়ার বাইরে: elusive।',false,'ok',28),array('english','[Questions 29 to 3